# YOLOv8 Fruit Detection Model

This file represents a placeholder for the YOLOv8 fruit detection model.
The actual model file (.pt) should be downloaded or trained separately.

## Model Training

To train your own model:

1. Prepare dataset with fruit images and YOLO format annotations
2. Use ultralytics training script:
   ```bash
   yolo train data=fruit_dataset.yaml model=yolov8n.pt epochs=100 imgsz=640
   ```

## Model Download

For demo purposes, you can use a pretrained YOLO model:
```bash
wget https://github.com/ultralytics/assets/releases/download/v0.0.0/yolov8n.pt
```